{"id":"nego_cio","lemma":"negócio","pos":"noun","rank":426,"glosses":["affair (that which is done or is to be done)","business, enterprise","thing, stuff"],"ipa":"/neˈɡɔ.sju/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/83/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-neg%C3%B3cio.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-neg%C3%B3cio.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"negócios"},"formAudio":{"negócios":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5d/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-neg%C3%B3cios.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Não quero ser envolvido nesse negócio.","en":"I don't want to be involved in this affair.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/485000","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"to involve","l":"envolver"},null,null]},{"text":"Eu não estou aqui a negócios.","en":"I'm not here on business.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/769953","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"am","l":"estar"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"the / to"},null]},{"text":"Eu fiz um negócio.","en":"I made a deal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/489741","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to create","l":"fazer"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tenho uma reunião de negócios.","en":"I have a business meeting.","words":[{"g":"have","l":"ter"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},{"g":"meeting, reunion"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Cada negócio é diferente.","en":"Each business is different.","words":[{"g":"each, every"},null,{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"different"}]}]}